('wikiloc', '38317728', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/turo-de-bell-lloc-100-cims-feec-ibp-40-hkg-04-07-2019-38317728', 'Turó de Bell-lloc [100 Peaks FEEC] - [IBP 40 HKG] - [04.07.2019]', '{"en":"Short loop from Dorres parking","ca":"Circular curta des de Dorres","es":"Circular corta desde Dorres"}'::jsonb, 'Turó de Bell-lloc [100 Cims FEEC] - [IBP 40 HKG] - [04.07.2019] Hiking trail in Dorres, Occitanie (France). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. RUTA GRABADA CON GARMIN ETREX 30X Y VERIFICADA CON BASECAMP :  
 
DISTANCIA TOTAL .................. 5''08 kms. 
TIEMPOS REALES: 
TIEMPO TRANSCURRIDO ....... 02:21:36 
TIEMPO EN MOVIMIENTO ...... 01:37:09 
TIEMPO DETENIDO ................. 00:44:27 
ALTURA MINIMA ......................1462 mts. 
ALTURA MAXIMA .................... 1704 mts. 
