('wikiloc', '3947145', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/besiberri-nord-3-008-m-des-de-panta-de-cavallers-vall-de-boi-p-n-daiguestortes-1250m-3947145', 'Besiberri North (3,008 m) from Cavallers Reservoir, Vall de Boí | Aigüestortes National Park {1250m+}', '{"en":"Circular from Cavallers Reservoir","ca":"Circular des del Pantà de Cavallers","es":"Circular desde el Pantano de Cavallers"}'::jsonb, 'Besiberri Nord (3.008 m) des de Pantà de Cavallers, Vall de Boí | P.N. d''Aigüestortes {1250m+} Hiking trail in Boí, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. CompeGps Land  
