Cartografia Editorial Alpina, mapa Costabona.', '{"en":"This moderate 13.3 km loop starts and ends in Setcases, offering 845m of elevation gain. The route begins on a well-trodden path towards Vilallonga de Ter, passing Clotagais and Nen de Llebro before joining a forest track.\n\nThe ascent continues on the track to Cubertat, then veers northwest to Pla Llobet. From there, leave the track and climb across meadows to Pla Magre, then north to the summit of Puig de les Agudes, a 360º viewpoint.\n\nThe descent follows the ridge from Puig Sistra, keeping to the cattle fence, passing Collada Fonda and Pla de les Bigues, where it connects with the GR 11.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 13,3 km amb 845 m de desnivell comença i acaba a Setcases. El recorregut s''inicia per un camí ben fressat cap a Vilallonga de Ter, passant per Clotagais i el Nen de Llebro abans d''unir-se a una pista forestal.\n\nL''ascens continua per la pista fins a la Cubertat, i després gira al nord-oest cap al Pla Llobet. Des d''allà, es deixa la pista i es puja per prats fins al Pla Magre, i després cap al nord fins al cim del Puig de les Agudes, un mirador de 360º.\n\nLa baixada segueix la carena des del Puig Sistra, mantenint-se prop de la tanca del bestiar, passant per la Collada Fonda i el Pla de les Bigues, on connecta amb el GR 11.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 13,3 km con 845 m de desnivel comienza y termina en Setcases. El recorrido se inicia por un camino bien trillado hacia Vilallonga de Ter, pasando por Clotagais y el Nen de Llebro antes de unirse a una pista forestal.\n\nEl ascenso continúa por la pista hasta la Cubertat, y luego gira al noroeste hacia el Pla Llobet. Desde allí, se deja la pista y se sube por prados hasta el Pla Magre, y luego hacia el norte hasta la cima del Puig de les Agudes, un mirador de 360º.\n\nEl descenso sigue la cresta desde el Puig Sistra, manteniéndose cerca de la valla del ganado, pasando por la Collada Fonda y el Pla de les Bigues, donde conecta con el GR 11."}'::jsonb, 'JORDI FREIXA SALA', 13261, 845, 845, 1985, 1250, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 17520, 3088, '2019-11-03', '2019-10', '[{"lat":42.374303,"lng":2.302055,"ele":1267.7},{"lat":42.374295,"lng":2.302048,"ele":1267.7},{"lat":42.37425,"lng":2.302013,"ele":1267.7},{"lat":42.374198,"lng":2.301988,"ele":1267.5},{"lat":42.374157,"lng":2.301962,"ele":1267.4},{"lat":42.374105,"lng":2.30193,"ele":1267.2},{"lat":42.374063,"lng":2.301905,"ele":1267},{"lat":42.374023,"lng":2.301873,"ele":1266.8},{"lat":42.373975,"lng":2.301848,"ele":1266.6},{"lat":42.373928,"lng":2.30182,"ele":1266.4},{"lat":42.373883,"lng":2.301792,"ele":1266.1},{"lat":42.373775,"lng":2.301727,"ele":1265.5},{"lat":42.373765,"lng":2.30172,"ele":1265.4},{"lat":42.373722,"lng":2.301695,"ele":1265.2},{"lat":42.373673,"lng":2.30166,"ele":1265},{"lat":42.373635,"lng":2.301627,"ele":1264.9},{"lat":42.373595,"lng":2.301597,"ele":1264.7},{"lat":42.37355,"lng":2.30156,"ele":1264.5},{"lat":42.373508,"lng":2.301528,"ele":1264.4},{"lat":42.373465,"lng":2.301488,"ele":1264.3},{"lat":42.373425,"lng":2.301448,"ele":1264.1},{"lat":42.373383,"lng":2.301403,"ele":1263.9},{"lat":42.373358,"lng":2.301352,"ele":1263.7},{"lat":42.373322,"lng":2.301295,"ele":1263.3},{"lat":42.373285,"lng":2.30124,"ele":1263.1},{"lat":42.373248,"lng":2.301195,"ele":1262.9},{"lat":42.373212,"lng":2.301147,"ele":1262.6},{"lat":42.37318,"lng":2.301098,"ele":1262.3},{"lat":42.373148,"lng":2.30104,"ele":1262},{"lat":42.373118,"lng":2.300987,"ele":1261.8},{"lat":42.373092,"lng":2.300918,"ele":1261.6},{"lat":42.373067,"lng":2.300863,"ele":1261.5},{"lat":42.373038,"lng":2.30081,"ele":1261.3},{"lat":42.373005,"lng":2.300763,"ele":1261.2},{"lat":42.372972,"lng":2.30072,"ele":1261.1},{"lat":42.372933,"lng":2.300667,"ele":1261},{"lat":42.37289,"lng":2.300632,"ele":1260.9},{"lat":42.37285,"lng":2.300588,"ele":1260.8},{"lat":42.372812,"lng":2.300543,"ele":1260.7},{"lat":42.372755,"lng":2.300532,"ele":1260.7},{"lat":42.372743,"lng":2.300533,"el