-“Castell de Popa per Balma del Torrent de les Esplugues, Fageda Sauva Negra i Bauma d’en Roma (troglodítica) desde Castellcir” 
ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-senderisme/castell-de-popa-per-balma-del-torrent-de-les-esplugues-fageda-sauva-negra-i-bauma-den-roma-troglodi-195575011', '{"en":"This easy 9.9 km loop with 302m of elevation gain starts from the ample parking area at the entrance of Granera, behind Santa Cecilia hermitage. The route explores both parts of the village, passing by Santa Cecilia hermitage, Sant Martí church, the Plaça de l''Era viewpoint, and Granera Castle.\n\nAfter the village, the trail follows the beautiful Serra de Granera ridge, passing El Pedró (847m) and deviating to Roc de l''Àliga (820m) before reaching the summit of Còdol del Castellar (833m), a great local viewpoint. The return descends via a hidden path towards Mas Vila-rúbia, then follows wider tracks through Baga de Vila-rúbia, passing dry stone huts and the Coll de Llebre.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil de 9,9 km amb 302m de desnivell positiu s''inicia des de l''aparcament a l''entrada de Granera, darrere de l''ermita de Santa Cecília. El recorregut explora ambdues parts del poble, passant per l''ermita de Santa Cecília, l''església de Sant Martí, el mirador de la Plaça de l''Era i el Castell de Granera.\n\nDesprés del poble, el sender segueix la bonica carena de la Serra de Granera, passant pel Pedró (847m) i desviant-se cap al Roc de l''Àliga (820m) abans d''arribar al cim del Còdol del Castellar (833m), un gran mirador local. El retorn descendeix per un corriol amagat cap al Mas Vila-rúbia, i després segueix camins més amples per la Baga de Vila-rúbia, passant per barraques de pedra seca i el Coll de Llebre.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 9,9 km con 302m de desnivel positivo se inicia desde el amplio aparcamiento a la entrada de Granera, detrás de la ermita de Santa Cecilia. El recorrido explora ambas partes del pueblo, pasando por la ermita de Santa Cecilia, la iglesia de Sant Martí, el mirador de la Plaça de l''Era y el Castillo de Granera.\n\nDespués del pueblo, el sendero sigue la hermosa cresta de la Serra de Granera, pasando por El Pedró (847m) y desviándose hacia el Roc de l''Àliga (820m) antes de llegar a la cima del Còdol del Castellar (833m), un gran mirador local. El regreso desciende por un sendero escondido hacia Mas Vila-rúbia, y luego sigue caminos más anchos por la Baga de Vila-rúbia, pasando por barracas de piedra seca y el Coll de Llebre."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 9881, 302, 302, 836, 661, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 15480, 892, '2020-02-16', '2019-10', '[{"lat":41.725631,"lng":2.062421,"ele":767},{"lat":41.725666,"lng":2.062206,"ele":768.5},{"lat":41.725659,"lng":2.062036,"ele":769.3},{"lat":41.725654,"lng":2.061805,"ele":770.7},{"lat":41.725602,"lng":2.0616,"ele":771.8},{"lat":41.72557,"lng":2.06156,"ele":771.8},{"lat":41.725546,"lng":2.06152,"ele":772},{"lat":41.725537,"lng":2.06151,"ele":772},{"lat":41.725482,"lng":2.061459,"ele":771.9},{"lat":41.725407,"lng":2.061412,"ele":771.1},{"lat":41.725288,"lng":2.061306,"ele":769.5},{"lat":41.725172,"lng":2.061146,"ele":768},{"lat":41.725076,"lng":2.060983,"ele":766},{"lat":41.725025,"lng":2.060826,"ele":764.5},{"lat":41.725,"lng":2.060665,"ele":763.4},{"lat":41.724976,"lng":2.060438,"ele":763.7},{"lat":41.724977,"lng":2.060201,"ele":765.4},{"lat":41.724949,"lng":2.059938,"ele":766.9},{"lat":41.72493,"lng":2.059797,"ele":766.8},{"lat":41.724912,"lng":2.059466,"ele":765.9},{"lat":41.724948,"lng":2.059257,"ele":765.8},{"lat":41.725047,"lng":2.058978,"ele":766.4},{"lat":41.725147,"lng":2.058695,"ele":765.4},{"lat":41.725224,"lng":2.058465,"ele":765.4},{"lat":41.725253,"lng":2.058173,"ele":764.1},{"lat":41.725314,"lng":2.0579,"ele":763.1},{"lat":41.725364,"lng":2.057657,"ele":762.6},{"lat":41.725342,"lng":2.057506,"ele":762.5},{"lat":41.725317,"lng":2.057365,"ele":762.8},{"lat":41.725297,"lng":2.057222,"ele":763.2},{"lat":41.725279,"lng":2.057159,"ele":762.8},{"lat":41.725246,"lng":2.057003,"ele":761.3},{"lat":41.725211,"lng":2.056938,"ele":760},{"lat":41.7252,"lng":2.056897,"ele":759.2},{"lat":41.725176,"lng"