-“Del Castell de Castellterçol a Sant Julià d’Uixols per Font del Prat del Pou, Pous de Neu i Poblat Ibéric de Puigcastellar” 
ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-senderisme/del-castell-de-castelltercol-a-sant-julia-duixols-per-font-del-prat-del-pou-pous-de-neu-i-poblat-ib-155547066 
 
-“Castell de Popa per Balma del Torrent de les Esplugues, Fageda Sauva Negra i Bauma d’en Roma (troglodítica) desde Castellcir” 
ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-senderisme/castell-de-popa-per-balma-del-torrent-de-les-esplugues-fageda-sauva-negra-i-bauma-den-roma-troglodi-195575011', '{"en":"This long and varied 20.9 km loop with 671m of elevation gain explores the hidden corners of Granera, starting from the village''s ample parking area. The route passes through the historic center, visiting Santa Cecilia and Sant Martí churches, the Plaça de l''Era viewpoint, and Granera Castle.\n\nThe trail then ascends to the viewpoints of Còdol del Castellar (833m) and Cingle del Salomó, offering extensive views. It continues past the small Marcet Reservoir, the Fonts de l''Avellaner and de les Febres, and explores several caves, including the interesting Coves de les Tutes (73m long) and the Forat Negre, which requires some scrambling for access. This moderate route is ideal for a full day of exploration.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular de 20,9 km i 671m de desnivell positiu explora els racons amagats de Granera, començant des de l''aparcament del poble. El recorregut passa pel centre històric, visitant les ermites de Santa Cecília i Sant Martí, el mirador de la Plaça de l''Era i el Castell de Granera.\n\nEl sender puja als miradors del Còdol del Castellar (833m) i el Cingle del Salomó, oferint vistes extenses. Continua passant pel petit Pantà del Marcet, les Fonts de l''Avellaner i de les Febres, i explora diverses coves, incloent les interessants Coves de les Tutes (73m de recorregut) i el Forat Negre, que requereix alguna grimpada per accedir-hi. Aquesta ruta moderada és ideal per a una jornada completa d''exploració.","es":"Esta ruta circular larga y variada de 20,9 km con 671m de desnivel positivo explora los rincones ocultos de Granera, partiendo del amplio aparcamiento del pueblo. El recorrido pasa por el centro histórico, visitando las ermitas de Santa Cecilia y Sant Martí, el mirador de la Plaça de l''Era y el Castillo de Granera.\n\nEl sendero asciende a los miradores del Còdol del Castellar (833m) y el Cingle del Salomó, ofreciendo vistas extensas. Continúa pasando por el pequeño Pantà del Marcet, las Fonts de l''Avellaner y de les Febres, y explora varias cuevas, incluyendo las interesantes Coves de les Tutes (73m de recorrido) y el Forat Negre, que requiere alguna trepada para acceder. Esta ruta moderada es ideal para un día completo de exploración."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 20905, 671, 671, 900, 632, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 21720, 1465, '2020-02-23', '2019-12', '[{"lat":41.725576,"lng":2.062456,"ele":767},{"lat":41.725662,"lng":2.06203,"ele":769.3},{"lat":41.725641,"lng":2.061766,"ele":770.9},{"lat":41.725564,"lng":2.061543,"ele":771.9},{"lat":41.725566,"lng":2.061548,"ele":771.9},{"lat":41.725553,"lng":2.061539,"ele":771.8},{"lat":41.725473,"lng":2.061477,"ele":771.5},{"lat":41.725266,"lng":2.061291,"ele":769.2},{"lat":41.725141,"lng":2.061157,"ele":767.5},{"lat":41.725004,"lng":2.060828,"ele":764.1},{"lat":41.724971,"lng":2.060475,"ele":763.5},{"lat":41.72496,"lng":2.060097,"ele":766.1},{"lat":41.72493,"lng":2.059856,"ele":766.6},{"lat":41.724927,"lng":2.059837,"ele":766.6},{"lat":41.7249,"lng":2.059494,"ele":765.5},{"lat":41.724979,"lng":2.059163,"ele":766.2},{"lat":41.725086,"lng":2.058886,"ele":766.4},{"lat":41.725166,"lng":2.0586,"ele":764.7},{"lat":41.725231,"lng":2.058301,"ele":764.4},{"lat":41.725279,"lng":2.05802,"ele":763.8},{"lat":41.725338,"lng":2.057782,"ele":762.5},{"lat":41.725352,"lng":2.057682,"ele":762.5},{"lat":41.725307,"lng":2.057407,"ele":762.6},{"lat":41.725282,"lng":2.057258,"ele":762.9},{"lat":41.725266,"lng":2.057155,"ele":762.4},{"lat":41.725233,"lng":2.057025,"ele":761},{"lat":41.72522,"lng":2.057014,"ele":760.5},{"lat":41.725197,"lng":2.056937,"ele":759.6},{"lat":41.72523,"lng":2.056837,"ele":759.4},{"lat":41.72524,"lng":2.056839,"ele":759.7},{"lat":41.725273,"lng":2.056843,"ele":760.8},{"lat":41.725359,"lng":2.056858,"ele":762},{"lat":41.725501,"lng":2.056819,"ele":763.4},{"lat":41.725581,"lng":2.057108,"ele":764.9},{"lat":41.72555